{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-06-07 11:30:00', 'title': "SIDD MANJESHWAR, AIR PRODUCTS' VICE PRESIDENT, TREASURY AND INVESTOR RELATIONS, TO SPEAK AT 2023 WELLS FARGO INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON JUNE 14", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , JUNE 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SIDD MANJESHWAR , VICE PRESIDENT, TREASURY AND INVESTOR RELATIONS, WILL SPEAK\xa0AT THE 2023 WELLS FARGO INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 14, 2023 AT 8:45 A.M.'}